[statement]
A requested name with a single candidate is settled first, but the names
that would require it are decided before it: `px`, requested, provides
`x3`, which `kw`, the one candidate for `w`, needs. `w` is decided before
`px` is installed, and `kw` answers `v`, so `gk` is not installed.
Contrast `a-requested-name-with-one-candidate-is-settled-first`.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:v w

P:kw
V:1
D:x3
p:v w=1

P:px
V:1
p:x3=1

P:gk
V:1
k:100
p:v

[request]
app
px

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install px 1
install kw 1
install app 1
